---
description: Architecture and coding rules for tcgen
globs: "**/*.py"
alwaysApply: true
---
- Keep every LLM call on the configured local Ollama endpoint; do not add cloud model providers.
- Unload the prior Ollama role model before switching roles to fit constrained local memory.
- Runtime role prompts belong in `src/tcgen/prompts/`, never inline in Python.
- LangGraph nodes exchange validated Pydantic models through named blackboard fields.
- Keep coverage and routing deterministic; the router must enforce the configured limit (maximum five).
- Preserve stable requirement/test IDs and source traceability.
- Inject model clients in tests; CI must not require Ollama or network model access.
- Add type hints and public-function docstrings; validate with Ruff, mypy, and pytest.
